{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","title":"Tidewatch Alerts","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":"projects/tidewatch","desc":"Push alerts for small-craft warnings and tide-gate closures, rate-limited per harbour.","intro":"Push alerts for small-craft warnings and tide-gate closures, rate-limited per harbour.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-19","synapses":["projects/tidewatch-alerts#1","projects/tidewatch-alerts#2","projects/tidewatch-alerts#3","projects/tidewatch-alerts#4","projects/tidewatch-alerts#5","projects/tidewatch-alerts#6","projects/tidewatch-alerts#7","projects/tidewatch-alerts#8","projects/tidewatch-alerts#9","projects/tidewatch-alerts#10"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","pplx://sessions/a4f8bd08-c6ca-f04c-b25d-fd526afe5edd","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/36","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/17","https://docs.example.org/marine-forecast-api"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch-alerts","parent":{"id":"projects/tidewatch","title":"Tidewatch","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":null,"desc":"Tidewatch is Sam Vale's sailing weather and tide planner for small-boat day trips, with a hosted web app and an offline phone build.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-18","synapses":22,"sources":5,"children":7,"links":13,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2ftidewatch.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#1","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Depth sounding needs an owner choice","text":"the wind polar is derived from the depth sounding in the hosted app; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#2","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Float plan needs an owner choice","text":"the float plan validates per harbour, but this does not establish arrival window acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#3","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Protected crew list","text":"the crew list validates on the phone and surfaces a plain warning when the tide gate is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/tidewatch"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/a4f8bd08-c6ca-f04c-b25d-fd526afe5edd","pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#4","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"No silent tide gate changes","text":"Sam chose to keep the tide gate and the depth sounding distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/hollow-pines-community"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","pplx://sessions/a4f8bd08-c6ca-f04c-b25d-fd526afe5edd"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#5","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Protected wind polar","text":"an earlier draft treated the wind polar as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine"],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/17","pplx://sessions/a4f8bd08-c6ca-f04c-b25d-fd526afe5edd"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#6","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"No silent harbour chart changes","text":"the harbour chart re-times per harbour and surfaces a plain warning when the crew list is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#7","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"No silent float plan changes","text":"an earlier draft treated the float plan as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#8","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Arrival window is not acceptance","text":"the arrival window caches on the phone and surfaces a plain warning when the depth sounding is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/17","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/36"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#9","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Protected harbour chart","text":"harbour chart changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check on the phone is bounded evidence, not proof that the float plan works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/36"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-alerts#10","page":"projects/tidewatch-alerts","lead":"Depth sounding survives rollback","text":"the depth sounding caches per harbour and surfaces a plain warning when the crew list is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/17","pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]}],"sources":[{"id":"pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","label":"5a8330d1","kind":"session","pages":["projects/tidewatch","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","projects/tidewatch-alerts","projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/a4f8bd08-c6ca-f04c-b25d-fd526afe5edd","label":"a4f8bd08","kind":"session","pages":["projects/tidewatch-passage-planner","projects/tidewatch-alerts","projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards"]},{"id":"https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/36","label":"sam-vale/tidewatch #36","kind":"github","pages":["projects/tidewatch-alerts"]},{"id":"https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/17","label":"sam-vale/tidewatch #17","kind":"github","pages":["projects/tidewatch-alerts"]},{"id":"https://docs.example.org/marine-forecast-api","label":"docs.example.org","kind":"web","pages":["projects/tidewatch-alerts","projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards","projects/moon-fox-field-guide","projects/rain-barrel-controller","learnings/2026-10-21","learnings/2026-10-25","learnings/2026-10-29"]}],"neighbours":{"out":[{"page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","w":5,"kinds":["mention","see-also"],"notes":["public demo","print partner"]},{"page":"projects/tidewatch-passage-planner","w":4,"kinds":["see-also"],"notes":["reference and rehearsal","public demo"]},{"page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","w":2,"kinds":["see-also"],"notes":["public demo"]}],"in":[{"page":"projects/tidewatch","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"projects/hollow-pines-community","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"learnings/2026-10-25","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"learnings/2026-10-26","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"learnings/2026-10-28","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"learnings/2026-10-29","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]}],"synapsesIn":[{"synapse":"learnings/2026-10-25#2","page":"learnings/2026-10-25"},{"synapse":"learnings/2026-10-26#4","page":"learnings/2026-10-26"},{"synapse":"learnings/2026-10-28#1","page":"learnings/2026-10-28"},{"synapse":"learnings/2026-10-29#1","page":"learnings/2026-10-29"}],"cocite":[{"page":"projects/tidewatch","w":1},{"page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","w":1},{"page":"projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards","w":3},{"page":"projects/tidewatch-passage-planner","w":1},{"page":"projects/moon-fox-field-guide","w":1},{"page":"projects/rain-barrel-controller","w":1}]}}
